{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t在北京，外交部回應美國中期選舉時表示，中期選舉是美國內政，中方願繼續同美方一道，維護好、落實好兩國元首重要共識，加強溝通、妥處分歧、拓展合作，構建基於尊重、公平、對等的中美建設性戰略穩定關係。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：梁家奇\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T12:05:28.668333+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T11:45:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T15:19:39.852566+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T11:58:42.567456+00:00","content_hash":"1be9686a4f3e6a7bc65c90ca757396ac3428c67211cdb7928149f6ed2b51fc79","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}